edge-vision-lab

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the code and original text and drawings in
this repository. It does not cover the data or third-party models named below.

Dataset (not redistributed)
  Svanstrom F., Alonso-Fernandez F., Englund C. "A dataset for multi-sensor
  drone detection". Data in Brief 39 (2021) 107521. DOI 10.1016/j.dib.2021.107521.
  Data: Zenodo, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.5500576 (v1.0.0).
  Licence status: the dataset repository's LICENSE file is CC0 1.0 Universal and
  its README says "Free to download, use and edit"; the Zenodo record says
  "Other (Open)". Written confirmation from the authors has been requested and
  has not been received. Until it is, this repository contains no frames, crops,
  sample images, split files derived from the data, or model weights trained on
  it. `python train/download_data.py` fetches the data from Zenodo into data/,
  which is gitignored.

Pre-trained starting weights (not redistributed)
  Training starts from torchvision's ImageNet weights for MobileNetV3-Small,
  downloaded at run time from download.pytorch.org. They are not stored in this
  repository. Their licence terms have not been verified (see docs/todo.md).

Third-party pre-trained model used by the website demo
  See docs/sources.md for its name, source, licence and size. It was not trained
  by this project.

Out-of-domain test images (planned, not downloaded)
  Open Images V7: annotations CC BY 4.0 (Google LLC); images listed as CC BY 2.0
  with per-image authors. A download script would write an attribution file.
